mma":"ஓய்","gloss":"you (vocative)"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"O dark beautiful one!"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நீயே","parts":[{"text":"நீ","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you indeed"},{"surface":"அஞ்சல்","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"அஞ்சு","gloss":"fear"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"prohibitive/negative suffix"}],"gloss":"do not fear"},{"surface":"என்ற","parts":[{"text":"என்ற","lemma":"என்","gloss":"which said"}],"gloss":"which said"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"சொல்","parts":[{"text":"சொல்","lemma":"சொல்","gloss":"word"}],"gloss":"word"},{"surface":"அஞ்சலையே","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"அஞ்சு","gloss":"fear"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"negative"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"second person singular suffix"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"you did not fear/doubt"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யானே","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"I indeed"},{"surface":"குறும்","parts":[{"text":"குறும்","lemma":"குறுமை","gloss":"short"}],"gloss":"short"},{"surface":"கால்","parts":[{"text":"கால்","lemma":"கால்","gloss":"leg/foot"}],"gloss":"legged"},{"surface":"அன்னம்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னம்","lemma":"அன்னம்","gloss":"swan/goose"}],"gloss":"swan/goose"},{"surface":"குவவு","parts":[{"text":"குவவு","lemma":"குவவு","gloss":"heaped/curved"}],"gloss":"heaped"},{"surface":"மணல்","parts":[{"text":"மணல்","lemma":"மணல்","gloss":"sand"}],"gloss":"sand"},{"surface":"சேக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"சேக்கும்","lemma":"சே","gloss":"will rest/roost"}],"gloss":"will rest/roost"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கடல்","parts":[{"text":"கடல்","lemma":"கடல்","gloss":"sea"}],"gloss":"sea"},{"surface":"சூழ்","parts":[{"text":"சூழ்","lemma":"சூழ்","gloss":"surrounded"}],"gloss":"surrounded"},{"surface":"மண்டிலம்","parts":[{"text":"மண்டிலம்","lemma":"மண்டிலம்","gloss":"world/earth"}],"gloss":"world/earth"},{"surface":"பெறினும்","parts":[{"text":"பெறினும்","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"even if obtaining"}],"gloss":"even if obtaining"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விடல்சூ","parts":[{"text":"விடல்சூ","lemma":"விடல்சூ","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ழலனான்","parts":[{"text":"ழலனான்","lemma":"ழலனான்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்னுடை","parts":[{"text":"நின்னுடை","lemma":"நின்னுடை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நட்பே","parts":[{"text":"நட்பே","lemma":"நட்பே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Blue water lily fragrant, thick dark tresses, / white water lily fragrant, honey-filled red mouth, / deep water lotus pollen like / fine many freckles, O dark beautiful one! / You indeed, 'do not fear' which said my word, did not doubt; / I indeed, short-legged swan on heaped sand roosts / sea-surrounded world even if obtaining, / leaving will not think, I, your friendship.","translation":"O dark beautiful one, with thick dark tresses fragrant like blue water lilies, a honey-filled red mouth fragrant like white water lilies, and fine, numerous freckles like the pollen of a lotus in deep water! You trusted my words when I said, 'Do not fear.' Even if I were to obtain the entire sea-girt world where short-legged swans roost on heaped sand dunes, I would never think of abandoning your friendship.","modern":"நீலக் குவளை மலரைப் போன்ற நறுமணம் வீசும் அடர்ந்த கரிய கூந்தலையும், தேன் நிறைந்த ஆம்பல் மலரைப் போன்ற நறுமணம் வீசும் பவளம் போன்ற வாயையும், ஆழமான நீர்நிலையின் தாமரை மலரின் மகரந்தத்தைப் போன்ற நுட்பமான பல தேமல்களையும் உடைய கரிய அழகியே! 'அஞ்சாதே' என்று நான் கூறிய சொற்களை நீ அப்படியே நம்பினாய். குறிய கால்களைக் கொண்ட அன்னப் பறவைகள் குவிந்த மணல் மேடுகளில் தங்கும் கடல் சூழ்ந்த உலகத்தையே நான் பரிசாகப் பெற்றாலும், உன்னுடைய நட்பைக் கைவிடுவதைப் பற்றி நான் ஒருபோதும் நினைக்க மாட்டேன்.","explanation":"The hero is speaking to the heroine to reassure her of his absolute commitment and love. He praises her exquisite beauty, describing her hair, mouth, and the beautiful freckles on her skin. He recalls how she trusted his comforting words when he told her not to fear during their secret meetings. He declares that even if he were offered the entire earth surrounded by the ocean, he would never dream of leaving her. The imagery of the short-legged swan resting peacefully on the heaped sand dunes of the sea-girt world symbolizes secure, undisturbed union and comfort, mirroring the trust the heroine placed in his words.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}